5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since it is the first day, we have no information to work with. I suggest we observe everyone's speech patterns and behavior carefully to identify any contradictions later.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I agree. I'll be watching everyone closely. If anyone starts acting weird or lying, I'm going to call them out immediately!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's just have fun and try our best to find the werewolf together. I'll be cheering for the village!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"A logical start. I'll be observing as well, though I suspect some of you are already feeling the pressure. Let's see who can maintain their composure as the game progresses.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka. Since we have no concrete evidence yet, observing each other's behavior is the most rational approach. Let's keep the discussion calm and see what unfolds.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Minako. For now, there is no need for hasty accusations. I will be focusing on how each of you reacts to the Seer's information once it emerges tomorrow.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not planning on being hasty, but I'm not going to sit back and do nothing either! I'll be the one to protect everyone, so just leave the detective work to me!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're so reliable! It's like having a superhero in the village! I'll be right here helping you out however I can!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your enthusiasm is admirable, but ""detective work"" requires a cool head, not just passion. I wonder if your eagerness to protect us is a genuine trait or a convenient mask.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, it is too early to judge whether Takumi's passion is a mask. For now, let's simply accept the different personalities in the group and focus on the flow of the conversation.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Minako. We should avoid premature judgments. I'll be paying attention to who tries to steer the conversation too aggressively or who seems overly eager to deflect suspicion.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, I'm not wearing a mask! I'm just telling it like it is. If you're so worried about ""cool heads,"" then just watch me find the werewolf and save everyone!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Wow, you two are already getting so intense! Let's not fight too much, okay? We're all on the same team! I'm just going to keep being positive and hope we can all get along!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, positivity is a fine sentiment, but it doesn't catch werewolves. @Takumi, your reaction is predictably emotional. It's quite amusing to see how easily some of you are provoked.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, provoking others does not help us find the werewolf. Let's try to maintain a productive atmosphere. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we move toward ending the day's discussion.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Minako. There is nothing more to be gained from discussion today. I will be waiting for the Seer's results tomorrow.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not provoked, I'm just ready! I'll be waiting too, and I'll be the first to spot any lies tomorrow.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
