24,0,4,talk,Mio,,I'm going to go get some snacks and get ready for tomorrow! Good luck to the Seer! I hope we get a great lead!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,It seems we have reached a consensus. I shall spend the night analyzing the patterns we've established today. I look forward to seeing how your masks slip tomorrow.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us conclude for today and wait for the Seer's findings. I will also be observing carefully.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
