69,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Wait, what?! Shion was attacked? That means Shion was actually the Seer! I knew we made the right call with Asuka, but now we've lost our best lead. We can't let the werewolf win now!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Mio,,Oh no! Shion is gone?! This is terrible! I can't believe the werewolf would do something so mean to the Seer! Now we're all in so much trouble! What are we going to do now?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Minako,,"It is a significant loss. Shion's death confirms their role as the Seer, as the werewolf would not attack their own ally. We are now left with Takumi, Mio, and myself. One of us is the werewolf.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not letting the werewolf win! Since Shion is gone, it's up to us to figure this out. @Mio, @Minako, one of you is the bad guy. I'm going to find out who it is!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're so scary when you're like this! I'm just a regular villager, I promise! @Minako, please help me! We have to think carefully so we don't make another mistake like we did with Asuka!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, please calm down. Panic will only benefit the werewolf. We must look at the facts: Shion confirmed you are human, so the werewolf is either Mio or me. We need to determine who is more likely to be lying.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, I'm not panicking, I'm focused! You're the one always talking about ""logic"" and ""rationality,"" but that's exactly how a werewolf would try to blend in. Why are you so calm while Mio is actually upset? It's suspicious!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, please don't be mean to Minako! She's just trying to help us think straight! I'm upset because we lost Shion, but that doesn't mean Minako is the bad guy just for being calm! We have to be careful!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, my composure is simply my nature, not a mask. If you equate emotional distress with innocence, you are relying on intuition rather than evidence. Let us consider the possibilities objectively. If I were the werewolf, would I have encouraged the vote against Asuka?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, you could have encouraged that vote just to get rid of a suspicious person and make yourself look like a good guy! That's exactly what a werewolf would do! I'm not falling for your ""objective"" act! I'm voting for you!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, please wait! I don't want to lose anyone else! But if you're really sure about Minako... I'm so confused! I'll just follow your lead because you're so determined, but I really hope we're right this time!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, your determination is admirable, but your logic is circular. You are voting for me simply because I am not reacting emotionally. If you execute me and I am human, the werewolf wins immediately. Please, think about the risk.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
